    "detailed_description": "Her Heart's Desire: A Landlord Epic Story:<br>With a past shrouded in mystery, you step into the role of a successful writer who's just had his first big break, selling a book to earn enough to become a home owner. Despite a massive drinking problem, you stay sober enough to place an ad for the spare bedrooms in your new home, and what luck, three gorgeous women apply to become your tenants! Daisy arrives first, fresh from the orphanage where she was kicked out on her birthday. Taking pity on the poor young woman, you celebrate with her the best way you can by getting her drunk. A gentleman wouldn't take advantage of the situation, but after she vomits into your toilet, it's game on.<br><br>The next day, while you need to continue working on your recently sold novel to wrap up the details, Lily and Rose arrive to sublet the other bedroom. Do they have deep, complicated backstories and rich personalities? No. Do they have incredible assets and the kind of smiles that make a dead soldier come back to life? Yes, yes they do. Get to know them, build up your like scores by selecting the best choice from the in-game menus, and get to know them intimately. As the story unfolds, you'll meet your book publisher, a sexy librarian, cheerleaders. The choice is yours whether to include them on your list of conquests, or focus on Daisy, Lily, and Rose. <br><br>Be careful with Daisy, since the unstable blonde moved in, it could be that scorning her is a fast ticket to getting your house burned down. Avoid the disaster, and choose which love interest to pursue in this light hearted adult visual novel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in the game:</h2>A simple narrative to explore with choices that influence the story.<br>More than 110,000 words of text, more than a full length novel.<br>3,600+ Crisp, beautiful images rendered in glorious HD.<br>Music and sound effects that deepen the experience.<br>43 fully animated adult scenes with unique animations with er